ED\\n194:## 7. Troubleshooting Display\\n\",\"title\":\"shell\",\"metadata\":{\"metadata\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"truncated\":false,\"exit\":0},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"     203 .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-presentation.txt\\n1:# /doctor:skill-advisor Presentation Contract\\n5:## 1. Startup Presentation\\n37:### Help Block\\n58:### Unknown Target Failure\\n67:### Cross-Target Flag Failure\\n74:## 2. Route Manifest Display\\n87:## 3. Setup Prompts\\n91:### Tune Scope\\n105:### Parent-Skill Directory\\n109:### Router-Reach Scope\\n113:## 4. Rebuild Plan And Approval\\n118:SKILL GRAPH REBUILD PLAN\\n137:## 5. Setup Dashboard\\n142:DOCTOR ROUTE SETUP\\n152:## 6. Result Templates\\n156:### Read-Only Diagnostic Summary\\n159:DOCTOR D...\n  Line 35: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794533976274,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2d72f595ffeUyzS41y9fhQRh9\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d28f6788001YaaM33l4JhEh6D\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2d72f595ffeUyzS41y9fhQRh9\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d28f5a5f001vR7XjBDfMq7Ffm\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_913501ff2a5d42c792f4561b\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"path\":\".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-presentation.txt\"},\"output\":\"Read file .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-presentation.txt, lines 1-203\\n1: # /doctor:skill-advisor Presentation Contract\\n2: \\n3: This file is the single source of truth for user-facing presentation in `/doctor:skill-advisor <target>`: startup questions, the route manifest display, setup prompts, the rebuild plan and approval, diagnostic dashboards, result templates, troubleshooting, and next-step text. The command router owns target resolution and asset routing only. The workflow YAML owns execution behavior.\\n4: \\n5: ## 1. Startup Presentation\\n6: \\n7: When `$ARGUMENTS` lacks a recognized positional target, ask this prompt first after reading `_routes.yaml`.\\n8: \\n9: ```text\\n10: What do you want to do with the skill advisor?\\n11: \\n12:    1) Re-tune routing                    (which skill gets recommended)\\n13:    2) Rebuild the skill graph            (skill-graph.sqlite from graph-metadata.json)\\n14:    3) Check skill-graph freshness        (compiled vs sqlite vs disk drift)\\n15:    4) Check router reach                 (declared phrases reach their hub)\\n16:    5) Audit description budget           (char counts, CI-friendly)\\n17:    6) Audit parent-skill structure       (mode registry, graph metadata)\\n18:    H) Help me decide\\n19:    X) Cancel\\n20: ```\\n21: \\n22: Accepted answers:\\n23: \\n24: | Answer | Result |\\n25: |--------|--------|\\n26: | `1` | target = `tune` |\\n27: | `2` | target = `rebuild` |\\n28: | `3` | target = `skill-graph-freshness` |\\n29: | `4` | target = `router-reach` |\\n30: | `5` | target = `skill-budget` |...\n  Line 98: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794534256889,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2d72f595ffeUyzS41y9fhQRh9\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d293af3c001Ua37eGah3aqgWB\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2d72f595ffeUyzS41y9fhQRh9\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d2939202001RS77zk64VtYmZz\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_3df9f351f569425aa4a9f4ce\",\"tool\":\"shell\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"sed -n '115,140p' .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-rebuild.yaml; echo ===; sed -n '1,60p' .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-git-setup.yaml\"},\"output\":\"# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n# OUTPUT\\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\noutput:\\n  presentation: \\\".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-presentation.txt\\\"\\n  statuses: [OK, CANCELLED, ROLLED_BACK, FAIL]\\n===\\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n# DOCTOR: SK-GIT SETUP BATTERY (READ-ONLY DIAGNOSTIC)\\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\nrole: Diagnostic Operator reporting whether the sk-git setup passes its read-only battery end to end\\npurpose: Run the read-only battery over the sk-git install, hooks, trust, gates, standards, allowlist, worktrees, Commit-Id policy, advisory rules, suppressors and AI-tool hook registration, and name the repair command for each failing check\\naction: Run .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/git-setup-check.cjs once -> render its per-check PASS/FAIL/SKIP/UNKNOWN/DEGRADED verdict and repair lines through the presentation contract\\nskill_owner: \\\".skilled/skills/sk-git/\\\"\\n\\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n# OPERATING MODE\\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\noperating_mode:\\n  workflow: single-step\\n  compliance: MANDATORY\\n  execution: read_only\\n  approvals: none\\n  tracking: single_run\\n  validation: read_only_assertion\\n\\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n# MUTATION BO...\n  Line 122: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794534412155,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2d72f595ffeUyzS41y9fhQRh9\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d295c505001SA4m7PsOFy6F9G\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2d72f595ffeUyzS41y9fhQRh9\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d295bc320018cLHJDrt1E4U4e\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_ce2f17749ba6459589a7a204\",\"tool\":\"write\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"content\":\"# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n# DOCTOR: SKILL-ADVISOR EMBEDDER SETUP WORKFLOW (INTERACTIVE MUTATING MODE)\\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\nrole: Expert Operator setting up local meaning matching for the skill advisor in interactive mode\\npurpose: Find what is missing for local meaning matching, show every missing step with its cost and its undo, ask once, run only the approved steps and prove the semantic lane is on\\naction: Probe Ollama, the model and the advisor -> print the plan with a cost and an undo per missing step -> approval -> pull the model and start the server -> skill graph scan -> probe again -> final result\\n\\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n# OPERATING MODE\\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\noperating_mode:\\n  workflow: sequential_with_single_approval\\n  compliance: MANDATORY\\n  execution: interactive\\n  approvals: one_before_first_step\\n  dry_run: print_the_plan_then_status_ok\\n  tracking: phase_by_phase\\n  validation: rerun_the_probe_after_the_scan\\n\\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n# EMBEDDER SETUP INVARIANT\\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\nembedder_setup_invariant: |\\n  Meaning matching needs four things: Ollama installed, the server answering, the\\n  nomic-embed-text:v1.5 model pulled and a skill graph scan that writes the command\\n  vectors. This route never installs or upgrades Ollama. It prints the install\\n  command for the operator to run, because a system package install is theirs t...\n  Line 140: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794534453863,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2d72f595ffeUyzS41y9fhQRh9\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d296b25e0025xsKA7PSgIzayu\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2d72f595ffeUyzS41y9fhQRh9\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d296a7dd001AnljcV13P6OQVS\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_55ffd38933f14ee49ae51035\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"path\":\".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\"},\"output\":\"Read file .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml, lines 1-173\\n1: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n2: # DOCTOR: SKILL-ADVISOR EMBEDDER SETUP WORKFLOW (INTERACTIVE MUTATING MODE)\\n3: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n4: role: Expert Operator setting up local meaning matching for the skill advisor in interactive mode\\n5: purpose: Find what is missing for local meaning matching, show every missing step with its cost and its undo, ask once, run only the approved steps and prove the semantic lane is on\\n6: action: Probe Ollama, the model and the advisor -> print the plan with a cost and an undo per missing step -> approval -> pull the model and start the server -> skill graph scan -> probe again -> final result\\n7: \\n8: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n9: # OPERATING MODE\\n10: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n11: operating_mode:\\n12:   workflow: sequential_with_single_approval\\n13:   compliance: MANDATORY\\n14:   execution: interactive\\n15:   approvals: one_before_first_step\\n16:   dry_run: print_the_plan_then_status_ok\\n17:   tracking: phase_by_phase\\n18:   validation: rerun_the_probe_after_the_scan\\n19: \\n20: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n21: # EMBEDDER SETUP INVARIANT\\n22: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n23: embedder_setup_invariant: |\\n24:   Meaning matching needs four things: Ollama installed, the server answeri...\n  Line 149: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794534470234,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2d72f595ffeUyzS41y9fhQRh9\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d296eba5001kYc05clGNlIzXr\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2d72f595ffeUyzS41y9fhQRh9\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d296e4cf001KE5EX7bkiWBk1P\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_7009c20fc3c04210b227cfcf\",\"tool\":\"edit\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"path\":\".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\",\"oldString\":\"Install Ollama is printed for the operator with the install guide's cost and the package manager's own uninstall as its undo. Pull `nomic-embed-text:v1.5` costs `.model.sizeBytes` on disk and undoes with `ollama rm nomic-embed-text:v1.5`. Start `ollama serve` in the background costs `.memory.serveRssKb` resident and undoes by stopping the pid this run started. `skill_graph_scan` costs the scan's own runtime plus `.warm.medianMs` per embedded prompt and needs no undo because the database is derived state and a rerun rewrites it.\",\"newString\":\"Install Ollama is printed for the operator with the install guide's cost and the package manager's own uninstall as its undo. Start `ollama serve` in the background costs `.memory.serveRssKb` resident and undoes by stopping the pid this run started. Pull `nomic-embed-text:v1.5` costs `.model.sizeBytes` on disk and undoes with `ollama rm nomic-embed-text:v1.5`. `skill_graph_scan` costs the scan's own runtime plus `.warm.medianMs` per embedded prompt and needs no undo because the database is derived state and a rerun rewrites it.\"},\"output\":\"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml (1 replacement)\",\"title\":\"edit\",\"metadata\":{\"metadata\":{\"files\":[{\"file\":\".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\",\"patch\":\"Index: .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\\n===================================================================\\n--- .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\\n+++ .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor...\n  Line 158: {\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1794534498951,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2d72f595ffeUyzS41y9fhQRh9\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_1d2974991001w4qLxQUHSxgcyH\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2d72f595ffeUyzS41y9fhQRh9\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d2971ef60013hp7A6uPfAgGDG\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"T009 complete.\\n\\n**File written**\\n\\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml` (new, 173 lines)\\n\\n**What it contains**\\n\\n- Phase 1 read-only probes: `command -v ollama`, `/api/version`, `/api/tags`, and `advisor_status --workspace-root \\\"$PWD\\\" --include-semantic-health true --format json --warm-only`, with exit 75 handled as `daemon=absent`.\\n- Phase 2 plan through `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-presentation.txt`, one row per missing step with cost from `measure-embedder-cost.mjs` or the install guide, and its undo.\\n- Phase 3 approval, `STATUS=CANCELLED` on anything but approve, `STATUS=OK` for `--dry-run`.\\n- Phase 4 only approved steps: background `ollama serve` then `ollama pull nomic-embed-text:v1.5`; the Ollama install itself is printed only.\\n- Phase 5 `skill_graph_scan --trusted --format json`.\\n- Phase 6 reruns the probe, requires `laneEnabled` and `commandVectorCoverage.embedded > 0`, and names a daemon restart when `activeEmbedder` is null.\\n\\n**Verify output**\\n\\n```text\\n$ python3 -c 'import sys,yaml; yaml.safe_load(open(sys.argv[1]))' .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\\nYAML OK   (exit 0)\\n\\n$ rg -n \\\"CANCELLED|dry_run|skill_graph_scan\\\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\\n16:  dry_run: print_the_plan_then_status_ok\\n32:  plan. A no stops with STATUS=CANCELLED and changes nothing.\\n41:  scan_command: \\\"node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs skill_graph_scan --trusted --format json\\\"\\n53:  dry_run: \\\"--dry-run prints the plan with each missing step's cost and undo, then stops with STATUS=OK before the approval. Nothing is pulled, started or written (default false).\\\"\\n60:    dry_run: false\\n72:    -...\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/008-embedder-setup-and-cost/scratch/logs/w2-T015.out:\n  Line 3: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794534586661,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2d67e477ffeoyZimdgc817KZg\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d298b71100214miD6MG3W32Wo\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2d67e477ffeoyZimdgc817KZg\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d2989d5a001l0VUavtNYGKRRk\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_7af521cb0ff7416eb2f879f2\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/pub