98:- [ ] T053 Write `implementation-summary.md` and mark each row in `acceptance-criteria.md` with its evidence. Verify: `bash .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/validate.sh <this folder> --strict` prints `RESULT: PASSED`.\\\\n== specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-comm...\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux/logs/fanout-lineage.out:\n  Line 55: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794523774067,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2e0e4b2cffeAWQl6ZGxUDL6xW\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d1f3b9d9001W5uf9biF0bW54k\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2e0e4b2cffeAWQl6ZGxUDL6xW\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d1f3b10f001PsMEzwSDs63TrO\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_849260d910664488940652a6\",\"tool\":\"shell\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"for f in specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/00{5,6,7,8}-*/tasks.md; do echo \\\"== $f\\\"; sed -n '63,160p' \\\"$f\\\" | rg -n 'T[0-9]{3}' | head -70; done\"},\"output\":\"92:- [ ] T047 Run `npm run build` in `ADV` and in `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime`. Verify: `$REC '{\\\"prompt\\\":\\\"save context\\\"}' | jq '[.data.recommendations[] | select(.command == \\\"/speckit:save\\\")] | length'` prints 1, and `$REC '{\\\"prompt\\\":\\\"/speckit:plan add a login page\\\"}' | jq -c '.data.recommendations[0] | {kind,command,policy,ownerSkillId}'` prints `{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"command\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"/speckit:plan\\\",\\\"policy\\\":\\\"start\\\",\\\"ownerSkillId\\\":\\\"system-spec-kit\\\"}`.\\n93:- [ ] T048 Run `node $S/brief-heads.mjs > $S/brief-heads-after.txt`. Verify: the first line reads `Advisor: live; use system-spec-kit → /speckit:plan (start) 0.82/0.16 pass.`, the git hooks line contains `/doctor:git hooks (ask)`, and `rg -c \\\"command-\\\" $S/brief-heads-after.txt` prints nothing.\\n94:- [ ] T049 With Ollama up, run `node $RC --hub sk-doc > $S/reach-after.txt`. Verify: it exits 0 and prints `outranked=0` and `RESULT: PASSED`.\\n95:- [ ] T050 Run `$S/hook-latency.mjs` three times (`$S/hook-latency-after-{1,2,3}.json`). Verify: the middle median is at most 25 ms over the T003 middle median and the middle p95 at most 40 ms over the T003 middle p95.\\n96:- [ ] T051 Run every gate. Verify: `node $D --check | jq -r .status` prints `fresh`, `$ROLL` prints `{\\\"ask\\\":17,\\\"run\\\":7,\\\"start\\\":20}`, `$P` prints `[159,50,20,5]`, `$TC` exits 0, `python3 $ADV/tests/python/test_skill_advisor.py` exits 0, `node $RT` exits 0, `node .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk..."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"pattern\":\"doctor-skill-advisor-presentation\\\\.txt\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794534613776,"end":1794534618514}}}}
