{"type":"text","timestamp":1794534773500,"sessionID":"ses_e2d67e477ffeoyZimdgc817KZg","part":{"id":"prt_1d29b4d2e002xzLFble014CnKx","sessionID":"ses_e2d67e477ffeoyZimdgc817KZg","messageID":"msg_1d29b1212001wqDtCNwm0AiCq4","type":"text","text":"Now I'll add the embedder presentation blocks to the contract.\n\n","time":{"start":1794534755630,"end":1794534773500}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794534773520,"sessionID":"ses_e2d67e477ffeoyZimdgc817KZg","part":{"partID":"prt_1d29b51440014z64qtv511Qd4j","sessionID":"ses_e2d67e477ffeoyZimdgc817KZg","messageID":"msg_1d29b1212001wqDtCNwm0AiCq4","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-89f94b68a681cbb7","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-presentation.txt","oldString":"| Route manifest parse error | Run `bash .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/route-validate.sh` |\n\nEnd interactive presentations with: `What would you like to do next?`","newString":"| Route manifest parse error | Run `bash .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/route-validate.sh` |\n\n## 8. Embedder Setup Presentation\n\nRender these blocks for `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder`. The probe runs first and changes nothing. Every value is printed as the probe or the cost script returned it, and an unread value stays unread.\n\n### Probe Dashboard\n\nRender after the read-only probe and before the plan.\n\n```text\nEMBEDDER SETUP PROBE\nOllama binary: [present at <path>|missing]\nServer: [answering at <url>, version <version>|absent at <url>]\nModel: [nomic-embed-text:v1.5 present, <size> on disk|missing]\nAdvisor daemon: [present|absent]\nActive embedder: [<backend> <model>|none|unread, the daemon is absent]\nCommand vectors: [<embedded> of <total>|unread, the daemon is absent]\nSemantic lane: [enabled|off ([disabledReason])|unread, the daemon is absent]\n```\n\nA missing binary, an absent server and a missing model are findings, not failures of the route. An exit 75 from `advisor_status` means the daemon is absent, so the active embedder, the command vectors and the lane state stay `unread`.\n\n### Plan Table\n\nRender one row per missing step, in dependency order. A step the probe found present is not listed and is not run. Each cost comes from `measure-embedder-cost.mjs` or, when the cost script cannot run, from the install guide with a note that the live measurement was unavailable.\n\n```text\nEMBEDDER SETUP PLAN\nMissing: [comma-separated steps, or none]\n\n| Step | Cost | Undo |\n|------|------|------|\n| Install Ollama (printed only, never run by this route) | [the install guide's cost] | [the package manager's uninstall command] |\n| Start ollama serve in the background | [.memory.serveRssKb from the cost script] resident | Stop the pid this run started |\n| Pull nomic-embed-text:v1.5 | [.model.sizeBytes from the cost script] on disk | ollama rm nomic-embed-text:v1.5 |\n| Run skill_graph_scan to write the command vectors | [the scan's own runtime] plus [.warm.medianMs from the cost script] per embedded prompt | None, the database is derived state and a rerun rewrites it |\n\nWill run after approval:\n   [the listed steps, in dependency order, or none]\n```\n\nWhen the probe found no missing step, skip the table and render the final result as already set up.\n\n### Approval Prompt\n\nAsk once, after the plan is on screen. Nothing is pulled, started or written before the answer, and approve is the only answer that proceeds.\n\n```text\nSet up meaning matching now? Only the steps in the plan run.\nSteps:\n   [one line per approved step with its cost]\nWrites: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/database/skill-graph.sqlite, through skill_graph_scan only\nNever: an Ollama install or upgrade, a model the plan did not list, a model removal, a second server\nReply approve to continue, or no to cancel.\n```\n\nAnything other than approve renders the cancelled result and stops.\n\n```text\nEMBEDDER SETUP CANCELLED\nNothing was pulled, started or written.\nNext: /doctor:skill-advisor embedder\nSTATUS=CANCELLED ACTION=cancelled\n```\n\n### Dry-Run Result\n\nWith `--dry-run`, stop after the plan, before the approval, and render this block.\n\n```text\nEMBEDDER SETUP DRY RUN\n[the probe dashboard]\n[the plan table, with each missing step's cost and undo]\n\nDry run: nothing was pulled, started or written.\nSTATUS=OK\n```\n\n### Final Result\n\nRender after the post-scan probe. When the probe found nothing missing, render the same block from the probe values, ask nothing and run nothing.\n\n```text\nEMBEDDER SETUP RESULT\nServer: [answering at <url>, version <version>|absent at <url>]\nModel: [nomic-embed-text:v1.5, <size> on disk|missing]\nCommand vectors: [<embedded> of <total>|0 of <total>]\nSemantic lane: [enabled|off ([disabledReason])]\nNext: [none|restart the advisor daemon, the active embedder is resolved at startup|the repair the failed check names]\nSTATUS=[OK|FAIL]\n```\n\nReport `STATUS=OK` only when the lane is enabled and the embedded count is above zero. Otherwise report `STATUS=FAIL` and name the check that did not pass. When the active embedder is null, name a daemon restart, then rerun the probe.\n\nEnd interactive presentations with: `What would you like to do next?`"},"output":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-presentation.txt (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-presentation.txt","patch":"Index: .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-presentation.txt\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-presentation.txt\n+++ .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-presentation.txt\n@@ -199,5 +199,98 @@\n | Rebuild failed and was rolled back | Read the failing command's output, fix the named graph-metadata.json, rerun `/doctor:skill-advisor rebuild` |\n | Cross-target flag rejected | Use the suggested target from the error |\n | Route manifest parse error | Run `bash .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/route-validate.sh` |\n \n+## 8. Embedder Setup Presentation\n+\n+Render these blocks for `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder`. The probe runs first and changes nothing. Every value is printed as the probe or the cost script returned it, and an unread value stays unread.\n+\n+### Probe Dashboard\n+\n+Render after the read-only probe and before the plan.\n+\n+```text\n+EMBEDDER SETUP PROBE\n+Ollama binary: [present at <path>|missing]\n+Server: [answering at <url>, version <version>|absent at <url>]\n+Model: [nomic-embed-text:v1.5 present, <size> on disk|missing]\n+Advisor daemon: [present|absent]\n+Active embedder: [<backend> <model>|none|unread, the daemon is absent]\n+Command vectors: [<embedded> of <total>|unread, the daemon is absent]\n+Semantic lane: [enabled|off ([disabledReason])|unread, the daemon is absent]\n+```\n+\n+A missing binary, an absent server and a missing model are findings, not failures of the route. An exit 75 from `advisor_status` means the daemon is absent, so the active embedder, the command vectors and the lane state stay `unread`.\n+\n+### Plan Table\n+\n+Render one row per missing step, in dependency order. A step the probe found present is not listed and is not run. Each cost comes from `measure-embedder-cost.mjs` or, when the cost script cannot run, from the install guide with a note that the live measurement was unavailable.\n+\n+```text\n+EMBEDDER SETUP PLAN\n+Missing: [comma-separated steps, or none]\n+\n+| Step | Cost | Undo |\n+|------|------|------|\n+| Install Ollama (printed only, never run by this route) | [the install guide's cost] | [the package manager's uninstall command] |\n+| Start ollama serve in the background | [.memory.serveRssKb from the cost script] resident | Stop the pid this run started |\n+| Pull nomic-embed-text:v1.5 | [.model.sizeBytes from the cost script] on disk | ollama rm nomic-embed-text:v1.5 |\n+| Run skill_graph_scan to write the command vectors | [the scan's own runtime] plus [.warm.medianMs from the cost script] per embedded prompt | None, the database is derived state and a rerun rewrites it |\n+\n+Will run after approval:\n+   [the listed steps, in dependency order, or none]\n+```\n+\n+When the probe found no missing step, skip the table and render the final result as already set up.\n+\n+### Approval Prompt\n+\n+Ask once, after the plan is on screen. Nothing is pulled, started or written before the answer, and approve is the only answer that proceeds.\n+\n+```text\n+Set up meaning matching now? Only the steps in the plan run.\n+Steps:\n+   [one line per approved step with its cost]\n+Writes: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/database/skill-graph.sqlite, through skill_graph_scan only\n+Never: an Ollama install or upgrade, a model the plan did not list, a model removal, a second server\n+Reply approve to continue, or no to cancel.\n+```\n+\n+Anything other than approve renders the cancelled result and stops.\n+\n+```text\n+EMBEDDER SETUP CANCELLED\n+Nothing was pulled, started or written.\n+Next: /doctor:skill-advisor embedder\n+STATUS=CANCELLED ACTION=cancelled\n+```\n+\n+### Dry-Run Result\n+\n+With `--dry-run`, stop after the plan, before the approval, and render this block.\n+\n+```text\n+EMBEDDER SETUP DRY RUN\n+[the probe dashboard]\n+[the plan table, with each missing step's cost and undo]\n+\n+Dry run: nothing was pulled, started or written.\n+STATUS=OK\n+```\n+\n+### Final Result\n+\n+Render after the post-scan probe. When the probe found nothing missing, render the same block from the probe values, ask nothing and run nothing.\n+\n+```text\n+EMBEDDER SETUP RESULT\n+Server: [answering at <url>, version <version>|absent at <url>]\n+Model: [nomic-embed-text:v1.5, <size> on disk|missing]\n+Command vectors: [<embedded> of <total>|0 of <total>]\n+Semantic lane: [enabled|off ([disabledReason])]\n+Next: [none|restart the advisor daemon, the active embedder is resolved at startup|the repair the failed check names]\n+STATUS=[OK|FAIL]\n+```\n+\n+Report `STATUS=OK` only when the lane is enabled and the embedded count is above zero. Otherwise report `STATUS=FAIL` and name the check that did not pass. When the active embedder is null, name a daemon restart, then rerun the probe.\n+\n End interactive presentations with: `What would you like to do next?`\n","status":"modified","additions":93,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-presentation.txt (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-presentation.txt\", \"oldString\": \"| Route manifest parse error | Run `bash .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/route-validate.sh` |\\n\\nEnd interactive presentations with: `What would you like to do next?`\", \"newString\": \"| Route manifest parse error | Run `bash .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/route-validate.sh` |\\n\\n## 8. Embedder Setup Presentation\\n\\nRender these blocks for `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder`. The probe runs first and changes nothing. Every value is printed as the probe or the cost script returned it, and an unread value stays unread.\\n\\n### Probe Dashboard\\n\\nRender after the read-only probe and before the plan.\\n\\n```text\\nEMBEDDER SETUP PROBE\\nOllama binary: [present at <path>|missing]\\nServer: [answering at <url>, version <version>|absent at <url>]\\nModel: [nomic-embed-text:v1.5 present, <size> on disk|missing]\\nAdvisor daemon: [present|absent]\\nActive embedder: [<backend> <model>|none|unread, the daemon is absent]\\nCommand vectors: [<embedded> of <total>|unread, the daemon is absent]\\nSemantic lane: [enabled|off ([disabledReason])|unread, the daemon is absent]\\n```\\n\\nA missing binary, an absent server and a missing model are findings, not failures of the route. An exit 75 from `advisor_status` means the daemon is absent, so the active embedder, the command vectors and the lane state stay `unread`.\\n\\n### Plan Table\\n\\nRender one row per missing step, in dependency order. A step the probe found present is not listed and is not run. Each cost comes from `measure-embedder-cost.mjs` or, when the cost script cannot run, from the install guide with a note that the live measurement was unavailable.\\n\\n```text\\nEMBEDDER SETUP PLAN\\nMissing: [comma-separated steps, or none]\\n\\n| Step | Cost | Undo |\\n|------|------|------|\\n| Install Ollama (printed only, never run by this route) | [the install guide's cost] | [the package manager's uninstall command] |\\n| Start ollama serve in the background | [.memory.serveRssKb from the cost script] resident | Stop the pid this run started |\\n| Pull nomic-embed-text:v1.5 | [.model.sizeBytes from the cost script] on disk | ollama rm nomic-embed-text:v1.5 |\\n| Run skill_graph_scan to write the command vectors | [the scan's own runtime] plus [.warm.medianMs from the cost script] per embedded prompt | None, the database is derived state and a rerun rewrites it |\\n\\nWill run after approval:\\n   [the listed steps, in dependency order, or none]\\n```\\n\\nWhen the probe found no missing step, skip the table and render the final result as already set up.\\n\\n### Approval Prompt\\n\\nAsk once, after the plan is on screen. Nothing is pulled, started or written before the answer, and approve is the only answer that proceeds.\\n\\n```text\\nSet up meaning matching now? Only the steps in the plan run.\\nSteps:\\n   [one line per approved step with its cost]\\nWrites: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/database/skill-graph.sqlite, through skill_graph_scan only\\nNever: an Ollama install or upgrade, a model the plan did not list, a model removal, a second server\\nReply approve to continue, or no to cancel.\\n```\\n\\nAnything other than approve renders the cancelled result and stops.\\n\\n```text\\nEMBEDDER SETUP CANCELLED\\nNothing was pulled, started or written.\\nNext: /doctor:skill-advisor embedder\\nSTATUS=CANCELLED ACTION=cancelled\\n```\\n\\n### Dry-Run Result\\n\\nWith `--dry-run`, stop after the plan, before the approval, and render this block.\\n\\n```text\\nEMBEDDER SETUP DRY RUN\\n[the probe dashboard]\\n[the plan table, with each missing step's cost and undo]\\n\\nDry run: nothing was pulled, started or written.\\nSTATUS=OK\\n```\\n\\n### Final Result\\n\\nRender after the post-scan probe. When the probe found nothing missing, render the same block from the probe values, ask nothing and run nothing.\\n\\n```text\\nEMBEDDER SETUP RESULT\\nServer: [answering at <url>, version <version>|absent at <url>]\\nModel: [nomic-embed-text:v1.5, <size> on disk|missing]\\nCommand vectors: [<embedded> of <total>|0 of <total>]\\nSemantic lane: [enabled|off ([disabledReason])]\\nNext: [none|restart the advisor daemon, the active embedder is resolved at startup|the repair the failed check names]\\nSTATUS=[OK|FAIL]\\n```\\n\\nReport `STATUS=OK` only when the lane is enabled and the embedded count is above zero. Otherwise report `STATUS=FAIL` and name the check that did not pass. When the active embedder is null, name a daemon restart, then rerun the probe.\\n\\nEnd interactive presentations with: `What would you like to do next?`\"}"},"time":{"start":1794534756677,"end":1794534773520}}}}
